	"name": "Bezier Edge",
	"library": "untitled",
	"category": "flow",
	"description": "Two mini graph nodes joined by an svg bezier edge in the Untitled UI style — tone-colored curve with endpoint dots and an optional dashed stroke. Interactive controls and editable values; saves private Things through an Action.",
